Chapter: RISC-V Runtime
  cites Foreword chapter RiscVEncoder

 Runtime helpers for RISC-V codegen. QEMU virt NS16550A UART
 at 0x10000000. Heap pointer in S1 (x9).

   s0=fp  s1=heap  s2-s7=helper locals  s8-s11=codegen locals
   t0-t6=scratch (28-31 ARE t3-t6, do NOT use raw 28-31)
   a0-a7=args/return

Section: Helper Infrastructure

  rv-rt-emit : List Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  rv-rt-emit (acc) (insn) = acc & insn

Section: __str_eq (with prologue)

  rv-rt-str-eq : List Integer
  rv-rt-str-eq =
   let i = []
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-addi rv-sp rv-sp (0 - 64))
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-sd rv-sp rv-ra 56)
