Section: __list_cons

   **The arguments are (element, list), and this helper had them the other way
 round.** x86-64 is the contract of record and its `__list_cons` reads the
 length out of `rsi`, the SECOND argument (`X86_64ListHelpers.codex`,
 `emit-list-cons-alloc`); ARM64's reads it out of `x1`; and both emitters,
 this lane's included, pass the element first. This helper read the list from
 `a0` and stored `a1` as the element, so `n :: acc` handed it the integer as
 a list pointer and the first `ld` faulted on it: `cause 5`, `tval` equal to
 the integer being consed.

 Nothing caught it because nothing on this lane conses. `list-view-probe` is
 the only test that uses `::` and it is PASS_REFUSED here for `__list-len`,
 so it never runs; the riscv battery has never executed this helper.
 `codex/test/list-cons-tail` is the guard, and it checks CONTENT rather than
 only length, because a length-only check passes against a cons that stores
 the wrong operand.

 The element is parked in `t6` across the allocation because `a0` is
 overwritten with the new list before the element is stored, and `t6` is not
 touched until the copy loop below.

  rv-rt-list-cons : List Integer
  rv-rt-list-cons =
   let i = []
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-mv rv-t6 rv-a0)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-mv rv-t0 rv-a1)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-ld rv-t1 rv-t0 0)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-addi rv-t2 rv-t1 1)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-sd rv-s1 rv-zero 0)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-addi rv-s1 rv-s1 8)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-mv rv-a0 rv-s1)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-addi rv-t3 rv-t2 1)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-slli rv-t3 rv-t3 3)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-add rv-s1 rv-s1 rv-t3)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-sd rv-a0 rv-t2 0)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-sd rv-a0 rv-t6 8)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-mv rv-t3 rv-zero)
   in let loop = list-length i / 4
   in let exit = list-length i / 4
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i rv-nop
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-slli rv-t4 rv-t3 3)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-add rv-t5 rv-t0 rv-t4)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-ld rv-t6 rv-t5 8)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-add rv-t5 rv-a0 rv-t4)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-sd rv-t5 rv-t6 16)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-addi rv-t3 rv-t3 1)
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i (rv-j ((loop - list-length i / 4) * 4))
   in let exit-label = list-length i / 4
   in let i = rv-rt-emit i rv-ret
   in rv-patch-insn-raw i exit (rv-bge rv-t3 rv-t1 ((exit-label - exit) * 4))

